[
    {
        "content": "<p>I consider the following Lean proof (from my Redhill PhD project) to be elegant:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Data</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Fintype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nonempty_double_not_dvd_four</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">by_cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">by_cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">by_cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"bp\">·</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>I'd like to see more examples of proofs you deem elegant. (See <a class=\"message-link\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/The.20role.20of.20AI.20companies.20in.20large.20formalisation.20projects/near/580249470\">#general &gt; The role of AI companies in large formalisation projects @ 💬</a> for context.)</p>",
        "id": 580253777,
        "sender_full_name": "Jeremy Tan",
        "timestamp": 1773854967
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>ah yes, <code>grind</code>. the most elegant way to prove something /s</p>",
        "id": 580264619,
        "sender_full_name": "Edward van de Meent",
        "timestamp": 1773858294
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>That proof is an interesting example for discussion, as I agree but with a (fixable?) caveat.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The non-trivial essence of a proof is often case splitting and instantiation (also intermediate lemmas). This proof has exactly that.</li>\n<li>The caveat is without the infoview the proof is obscure. Maybe tooling should easily add infoview states as comments.</li>\n</ul>",
        "id": 580392545,
        "sender_full_name": "Siddhartha Gadgil",
        "timestamp": 1773916796
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Of course there are various ways you could golf into only needing to call <code>grind</code> once (which as I understand it is somewhat preferable for performance). If you want to keep the same flavor as what you wrote above:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Data</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Fintype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nonempty_double_not_dvd_four</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">use</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>or even in one line as</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Data</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Fintype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nonempty_double_not_dvd_four</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">disch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 580411830,
        "sender_full_name": "Chris Henson",
        "timestamp": 1773922768
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"684366\">Edward van de Meent</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/Elegance.20in.20Lean.20proofs/near/580264619\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>ah yes, <code>grind</code>. the most elegant way to prove something /s</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I agree when we say \"elegance\" we usually mean <em>mathematical</em> elegance, but I also think this is a good usage of <code>grind</code>.</p>",
        "id": 580412297,
        "sender_full_name": "Chris Henson",
        "timestamp": 1773922920
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The result only depends on the remainders of <code>v</code> and <code>w</code> mod 4 (viewed in <code>Fin 4</code>). If there were an analogue of the Rocq “trocq” tactic,  the result would be obvious by case inspection.</p>",
        "id": 580586122,
        "sender_full_name": "Antoine Chambert-Loir",
        "timestamp": 1773989362
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"687698\">Chris Henson</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113488-general/topic/Elegance.20in.20Lean.20proofs/near/580411830\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Data</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Fintype</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Basic</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nonempty_double_not_dvd_four</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">disch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∈</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">if</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">then</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">else</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n</code></pre></div><br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>This proof would surely look nicer with some kind of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iverson_bracket\">Iverson bracket</a>.</p>",
        "id": 580589908,
        "sender_full_name": "suhr",
        "timestamp": 1773991333
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>We have the <code>mod_cases</code> tactic to reason modulo, say, <code>4</code>.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">maxHeartbeats</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nonempty_double_not_dvd_four</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">mod_cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;;&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mod_cases</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">hw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">all_goals</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">try</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ModEq</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">all_goals</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">try</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ModEq</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">all_goals</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">try</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ModEq</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">all_goals</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">try</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exact</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⟨</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Nat</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ModEq</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"bp\">⟩</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>But it is ridiculously slow <span aria-label=\"pensive\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f614\" role=\"img\" title=\"pensive\">:pensive:</span></p>",
        "id": 580721033,
        "sender_full_name": "Riccardo Brasca",
        "timestamp": 1774030125
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I prefer the following approach:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span>\n\n<span class=\"sd\">/-- info: Used 7317 heartbeats, which is less than the current maximum of 200000. -/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Elab</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">async</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">false</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">count_heartbeats</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nonempty_double_not_dvd_four</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">suffices</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">({</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">({</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ZMod</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ZMod</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">this</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">generalize</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ZMod</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ZMod</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"n\">revert</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">ext</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"bp\">←</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ZMod</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">natCast_eq_zero_iff</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">norm_cast</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Usually, working in <code>ZMod n</code> is quite fast  via <code>decide</code>.</p>",
        "id": 580733049,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Stoll",
        "timestamp": 1774035100
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>My main issue with using ZMod is that the user doesn't see the type in the infoview, while knowing the modulus is crucial. How are you supposed to read this state?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"sd\">/--</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">error: unsolved goals</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">v w : ℕ</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">⊢ {i | ¬4 ∣ v + ↑i ∧ ¬2 ∣ w + ↑i} = {i | ↑v + ↑↑i ≠ 0 ∧ ↑w + ↑↑i ≠ 0}</span>\n<span class=\"sd\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">guard_msgs</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">nonempty_double_not_dvd_four</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Nonempty</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">suffices</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">({</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">¬</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∣</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"o\">({</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Fin</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ZMod</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∧</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ℕ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ZMod</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">≠</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finset</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">_</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">this</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">generalize</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ZMod</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">w</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ZMod</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"n\">revert</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 580769431,
        "sender_full_name": "Mirek Olšák",
        "timestamp": 1774055998
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>by clicking around in the infoview, or with <code>set_option pp.numericTypes true</code></p>",
        "id": 580771912,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1774056709
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Okay, <code>set_option pp.numericTypes true</code> solves this case (somewhat, it is unnecessarily verbose to write <code>(0 : ZMod (4 : ℕ))</code>). However, it does't solve the general issue that <code>↑a = ↑b</code> does not display modulo what number we are taking this (and yes, I know I can hover but that is annoying). This is simply the reason why I cannot recomment <code>ZMod</code> for standard mathematical practice (at least if there are more than two numeric types in the problem).</p>",
        "id": 580774169,
        "sender_full_name": "Mirek Olšák",
        "timestamp": 1774058629
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>the solution, of course, it to <code>set_option pp.coercions.types true</code></p>",
        "id": 580774567,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1774058968
    }
]